Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Dr. Octo Rex Loop Player
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (loop-slot templates below)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> filter / filter-env group (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> LFO group                 (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//
//  NOTE: Reason keeps the Dr. REX device ID for the Dr. Octo Rex
//  (backwards compatibility). Scope line below therefore reads
//  "Dr.REX Loop Player" while the device shown in the rack is the
//  Dr. Octo Rex Loop Player.
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	Dr.REX Loop Player
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	FilterMod	LFO	Env	Patch
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Dr. Octo Rex"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// Dr. Octo Rex has no drum pads. Ready-to-enable templates:
//Map	Pad 1		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 2		Select Next Patch
//Map	Pad 3		Loop Transpose
//Map	Pad 4		Loop Level
//Map	Pad 5		Enable Loop Playback
//Map	Pad 6		Notes To Slot

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): filter & filter envelope ----
Map	Knob 1 A		Filter Freq
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter Res
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter Env Amount
Map	Knob 4 A		LFO1 Rate

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): LFO shaping ---------------
Map	Knob 1 B		LFO1 Amount
Map	Knob 2 B		Filter Mode
Map	Knob 3 B		LFO1 Wave
Map	Knob 4 B		LFO1 Dest

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel